{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious pandemic has suddenly broken out! Find a cure to save those infected with the virus and stand against humanity's dire situation! A rescue action game with simple controls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Game Content\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist is a rescue team member tasked with saving people infected with the virus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect medical treatments scattered throughout the city and rescue those infected within the time limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist can use a feature called &quot;Triage Search&quot; to check the status of infected people and locate those hiding. Making effective use of &quot;Triage Search&quot; will allow for more efficient rescue operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also various obstacles blocking your path in the city. Use items found on the ground to clear your way through these obstacles and rescue those in need!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Number of Stages] 5 stages in total! Aim for an &quot;S-Rank&quot; on every stage and rescue the townspeople!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Controls\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3008Keyboard\u3009</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ENTER, Z\uff1aConfirm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ESC, X, 0 (numeric keypad)\uff1aCancel, use Triage Search</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >D-pad, WASD\uff1aSelect, move character</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3008Mouse\u3009</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left-click\uff1aConfirm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right-click\uff1aCancel, use Triage Search</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left-click on the screen\uff1aMove character</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3686140?t=1756011708","backg